# Downloaded model checkpoints, extracted archives, and derived weight files.
# ~2.5 GB total (the .nemo checkpoint, its full tar extraction, and a
# re-saved CTC-only state dict). Re-derivable from load_susrota_ctc.py +
# huggingface_hub download -- see 09-*.md / SETUP.md for exact commands.
models/

# Third-party audio (CC BY 4.0, prathoshap/sushrota-sanskrit-asr-data) and
# synthetic hard-negative WAVs generated by the test scripts. Re-derivable
# by re-running extract_held_out_clips.py and run_p4_p5_tests.py. Keep the
# small JSON manifests/results (held_out_manifest.json, *_results.json) --
# those are the actual evidence artifacts and are text, not binaries.
clips/*.wav
clips/held_out/

# scratch dumps from interactive probing
aux_ctc_dump.json

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
